  {
   "key": "u27666",
   "en": "Left Stick: Move\nRight Stick: Look\n\nCross button: Activate/Interact/Storm\nSquare button: Draw Weapon\nTriangle button: First Aid\nCircle button: Holster Weapon\n\nL1 button: Toggle Last Weapon/Hold to Use Weapon Wheel\nL2 button: Zoom\nR1 button: Use Favorite Power/Hold to Use Power Wheel\nR2 button: Fire Weapon\n\nUp button: Order squadmates to move to selected position\nRight button: Order squadmates to fire on selected target\nDown button: Order squadmates to take cover at selected position\nLeft button: Order squadmates to rally to your position\n\nSELECT button: Grenade\nSTART button: Mission Computer",
   "tr": "",
